{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン見る横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動大.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "$210200" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "人物2" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動舌.lcm" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "人物2" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動普通.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "300" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The sensation of the adrenaline level rising.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sensation of being filled with noradrenaline.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Abnormal brain waves. A rising heart rate. Curiosity that can't be held down.<PG>
Incident, incident, incident, incident, incident, incident, incident, incident, incident, incident!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a huge incident, the kind that comes once in a lifetime, if that!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On a global scale, it probably isn't all that rare.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, that happened right here in <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="さわけん">Sawa Prefecture</STYLE>, in <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="もときちょう">Motoki-cho</STYLE>!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動にか.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The patrol cars this morning had me thinking, maybe...? But this went beyond what I expected!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A murder in this <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="もときちょう">Motoki-cho</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And what's more, it happened on this April 8!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way I can keep quiet about this!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, greedy for new things, for worlds not yet seen, there is only one way to calm down!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unravel the mystery!<PG>
The method is simple.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Search every last bit of information that's up on the net right now!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The source can be anywhere! It can be anything!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether information is a lie or not, that much I can see through myself!<PG>
There are people who say relying on the net is laziness, that it's unproductive, and so on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those people just don't know how to get useful information from the net.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise, there's no way the net would have spread through this world as far as it has.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島タイピング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島マウス.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\duble_clicks.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"April 8, just as I thought...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hmmm... I see, I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> 790... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> 794... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> 797... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And this year, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> 800... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Three times in the past, similar incidents happened on April 8 as well! Could there be some kind of rule to it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not for anyone to hear, the talk to myself spills naturally from my mouth.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\writing_in_a_pen.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島メモ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmmmn... Information from the net has its limits... I guess I have to do door-to-door questioning after all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Before the questioning, shall I check the school message board?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
High schoolers' information is fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, for all that speed, there are lots of false rumors too.<PG>
But, where there's no fire, there's no you-know-what.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Smoke out the truth mixed in among the lies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, that sort of thing is easy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島マウス.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\duble_clicks.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The quick ones have already gotten hold of all kinds of information. In Central Park, a brutalized body too horrible to look at. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Dumped in the early morning... one victim, it says... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">One victim, that's quite different from the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="めがさわ">Megasawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="し"> City</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> murders. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe the other one just hasn't been found yet..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動2.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Even so, a murder here in </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="もときちょう">Motoki-cho</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, rare things do happen. The sky falling in would be far more realistic. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">This time, not the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="めがさわ">Megasawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="し"> City</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> murders, but the </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="もときちょう">Motoki-cho</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> murders, is that what we'd call it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="めがさわ">Megasawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="し"> City</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> murders... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Every time one happens, all of Japan is in an uproar, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And now this time, it happens in Motoki-cho... Did the killer move over here or something?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm, now that my prep on the net is done, I suppose it's finally time to go do door-to-door questioning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, since I'm going anyway, maybe I should invite those two as well...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, they're worn down at this time of year, and on top of that, they're bad with unsettling talk like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably, the two of them are together today.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動普通.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "-100" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
This time, this genius girl, <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE>, shall charge into the scene alone!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\始動\始動にか.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Carrying out the Operation!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
